   "id": "T3AVbfzx06UVZyvmbPkZy",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1494,
   "y": 132,
   "width": 392.70000000000005,
   "height": 140.0,
   "text": "ingredient -> canonical id (internal table)\nforms      -> per-ingredient enum + salt family\noutcomes   -> fixed vocab, 25-30 terms, v1\ndose_band  -> clustered from trial doses, versioned\npopulation -> 4 coarse axes\n\nONE SCAN => MANY ECUs (one row per outcome).\nLabel claim only picks which row is highlighted.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "9nde9syxoAwuKmhr7jmPY",
