   "type": "text",
   "x": 1494,
   "y": 392,
   "width": 338.8,
   "height": 192.5,
   "text": "Postgres, NOT a vector DB.\nAccess pattern is exact-key lookup\non a 5-tuple -> btree index.\n\nTABLES\n ecu(id, ingredient, form, dose_band,\n     outcome, population, score, d, c, H,\n     band_version, computed_at)\n ecu_study(ecu_id, study_id, w_study, s_i)\n study(id, nct, doi, pmid, design, rob, ...)\n synthesis(id, amstar, included_ids[])",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "Jh8NoMtwh6c9eOnzxTBE8",
   "originalText": "Postgres, NOT a vector DB.\nAccess pattern is exact-key lookup\non a 5-tuple -> btree index.\n\nTABLES\n ecu(id, ingredient, form, dose_band,\n     outcome, population, score, d, c, H,\n     band_version, computed_at)\n ecu_study(ecu_id, study_id, w_study, s_i)\n study(id, nct, doi, pmid, design, rob, ...)\n synthesis(id, amstar, included_ids[])",
   "autoResize": false,
