   "id": "B1SFxu9AZB7N85_x_AX1j",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1494,
   "y": 702,
   "width": 331.1,
   "height": 210.0,
   "text": "RATE LIMITS  (v1 = unauthenticated)\n NCBI   ~3 req/s  -> 10 req/s with free key\n EuroPMC ~generous, be polite\n ct.gov  ~generous\n Epistemonikos - unknown, backoff hard\n\nToken bucket PER DOMAIN + exp backoff.\nConcurrency 6-8 workers.\nBottleneck is fetch, not tokens (Amdahl).\n\nAlso: Crossref / Retraction Watch\n-> retracted studies get w_study = 0.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "GpE17lDUNRBfuZhRw7YBW",
   "originalText": "RATE LIMITS  (v1 = unauthenticated)\n NCBI   ~3 req/s  -> 10 req/s with free key\n EuroPMC ~generous, be polite\n ct.gov  ~generous\n Epistemonikos - unknown, backoff hard\n\nToken bucket PER DOMAIN + exp backoff.\nConcurrency 6-8 workers.\nBottleneck is fetch, not tokens (Amdahl).\n\nAlso: Crossref / Retraction Watch\n-> retracted studies get w_study = 0.",
   "autoResize": false,
