   "id": "sWhBS42op6371XDWfe55K",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1494,
   "y": 1002,
   "width": 385.00000000000006,
   "height": 210.0,
   "text": "CLASSIFY: PubMed publicationType + MeSH first\n(deterministic, ~85-90% correct).\nLLM fallback ONLY on ambiguous.\n\nDEDUP is pure code, never an LLM.\n same NCT      -> one unit\n same DOI      -> one unit\n fingerprint   -> (author, year, n, country, dose)\n\nUnresolved syntheses: ALL of them together\ncap at the weight of ONE median primary.\nFail toward under-counting.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "ZmPAcwPinP38C-0wIiXPx",
   "originalText": "CLASSIFY: PubMed publicationType + MeSH first\n(deterministic, ~85-90% correct).\nLLM fallback ONLY on ambiguous.\n\nDEDUP is pure code, never an LLM.\n same NCT      -> one unit\n same DOI      -> one unit\n fingerprint   -> (author, year, n, country, dose)\n\nUnresolved syntheses: ALL of them together\ncap at the weight of ONE median primary.\nFail toward under-counting.",
   "autoResize": false,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "seed": 198255471,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 234510283,
   "index": "b0073"
