   "x": 1494,
   "y": 2182,
   "width": 331.1,
   "height": 315.0,
   "text": "ALL ARITHMETIC IS CODE, NOT LLM.\n\ns_i vs the LABEL CLAIM:\n  meaningful benefit   +1.0\n  trivial benefit      +0.3\n  null / no effect     -0.7   <- key\n  harm                 -1.0\n\nk ~ 3 RCT-equivalents  (MUST be calibrated)\n\nBANDS\n +70..+100 strong support\n +30.. +69 moderate\n +10.. +29 weak\n  -9.. + 9 inconclusive\n -10.. -39 weak against\n -40.. -69 does not work\n -70..-100 strong against / harm",
   "fontSize": 14,
