   "type": "text",
   "x": 2114,
   "y": -178,
   "width": 431.20000000000005,
   "height": 315.0,
   "text": "DESIGN WEIGHT w_d  (v1, non-linear)\n-------------------------------------------\n1-3 Umbrella / SR+MA / SR  -> multiplier path\n4   RCT                       1.00\n5   Non-randomised CT         0.55  randomisation cliff\n6   Prospective cohort        0.30  interventional cliff\n7   Retrospective cohort      0.18\n8   Case-control              0.12\n9   Cross-sectional           0.07\n10  Case series               0.03  control-group cliff\n11  Case report               0.015\n12  Animal                    0.004 species cliff\n13  In vitro                  0.0015\n14  Expert opinion/marketing  0.00  HARD ZERO\n\nw = 0.62^(rank-4) with 3 manual cliffs.\nRanks 1-3 contain no new patients -> they are a\nbounded multiplier, never evidence mass.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "VBivLfaTkTfA3ECmTMhq4",
   "originalText": "DESIGN WEIGHT w_d  (v1, non-linear)\n-------------------------------------------\n1-3 Umbrella / SR+MA / SR  -> multiplier path\n4   RCT                       1.00\n5   Non-randomised CT         0.55  randomisation cliff\n6   Prospective cohort        0.30  interventional cliff\n7   Retrospective cohort      0.18\n8   Case-control              0.12\n9   Cross-sectional           0.07\n10  Case series               0.03  control-group cliff\n11  Case report               0.015\n12  Animal                    0.004 species cliff\n13  In vitro                  0.0015\n14  Expert opinion/marketing  0.00  HARD ZERO\n\nw = 0.62^(rank-4) with 3 manual cliffs.\nRanks 1-3 contain no new patients -> they are a\nbounded multiplier, never evidence mass.",
   "autoResize": false,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "seed": 518131933,
   "version": 1,
