   "updated": 1785777351988,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "id": "M5sZ_du_x-BOSzh4684rL",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2114,
   "y": 282,
   "width": 392.70000000000005,
   "height": 262.5,
   "text": "TRANSFER FACTOR  (the moat)\n---------------------------------------\nFORM                     DOSE vs studied band\n exact match     1.00     inside band      1.00\n same salt family 0.50    50-99% of low end 0.45\n different form   0.15    < 50%             0.10\n unspecified      0.30    > 200%            0.60\n\nPOPULATION  exact 1.00 / adjacent 0.70 / other 0.35\n\ntransfer = form x dose x population\n\n400mg Mg citrate trial -> 100mg Mg oxide SKU\n  = 0.15 x 0.10 x 1.00 = 0.015 of original weight\nThat single number is the product.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "7XEvi5AaFq8kS81obrKrd",
   "originalText": "TRANSFER FACTOR  (the moat)\n---------------------------------------\nFORM                     DOSE vs studied band\n exact match     1.00     inside band      1.00\n same salt family 0.50    50-99% of low end 0.45\n different form   0.15    < 50%             0.10\n unspecified      0.30    > 200%            0.60\n\nPOPULATION  exact 1.00 / adjacent 0.70 / other 0.35\n\ntransfer = form x dose x population\n\n400mg Mg citrate trial -> 100mg Mg oxide SKU\n  = 0.15 x 0.10 x 1.00 = 0.015 of original weight\nThat single number is the product.",
   "autoResize": false,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "seed": 1175514952,
