   "updated": 1785777351988,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "id": "rpk2nrnjj4uJgczS3mriH",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2114,
   "y": 672,
   "width": 423.50000000000006,
   "height": 192.5,
   "text": "DEDUP MATH\n------------------------------\nP   = unique primary trials for this ECU\nI_s = included trials of synthesis s\n\nE   = SUM over p in P of w_study(p)     unique only\ncov = max over s of |I_s AND P| / |P|\nE'  = E x (1 + 0.3 x cov x q_s)         bounded 1.0-1.3\n\n30 meta-analyses over 9 RCTs -> E built from 9.\nAll syntheses combined add at most +30%.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "LyIMisiU7k19AkW64hp0s",
   "originalText": "DEDUP MATH\n------------------------------\nP   = unique primary trials for this ECU\nI_s = included trials of synthesis s\n\nE   = SUM over p in P of w_study(p)     unique only\ncov = max over s of |I_s AND P| / |P|\nE'  = E x (1 + 0.3 x cov x q_s)         bounded 1.0-1.3\n\n30 meta-analyses over 9 RCTs -> E built from 9.\nAll syntheses combined add at most +30%.",
   "autoResize": false,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "seed": 681529075,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 199901615,
   "index": "b0170"
  },
