   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1785777351988,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "id": "HBSvdGeNofFEimys7IyUa",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2114,
   "y": 982,
   "width": 423.50000000000006,
   "height": 227.5,
   "text": "6-ITEM RoB 2 PROXY  (per RCT)\n----------------------------------------------\n1 randomisation METHOD described\n2 double-blind + placebo control\n3 prospectively registered, BEFORE enrolment   [ct.gov]\n4 reported primary outcome == registered one   [ct.gov]\n5 attrition < 20%, per arm, with reasons\n6 ITT stated and n_analysed == n_randomised\n\n5-6 -> 1.00 low   3-4 -> 0.60 some   0-2 -> 0.25 high\n\nItems 3+4 are ONE ct.gov call which also emits the\n'registered but never published' flag. Build first.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "BS0A8ABc0dlZtbSRFxzJL",
   "originalText": "6-ITEM RoB 2 PROXY  (per RCT)\n----------------------------------------------\n1 randomisation METHOD described\n2 double-blind + placebo control\n3 prospectively registered, BEFORE enrolment   [ct.gov]\n4 reported primary outcome == registered one   [ct.gov]\n5 attrition < 20%, per arm, with reasons\n6 ITT stated and n_analysed == n_randomised\n\n5-6 -> 1.00 low   3-4 -> 0.60 some   0-2 -> 0.25 high\n\nItems 3+4 are ONE ct.gov call which also emits the\n'registered but never published' flag. Build first.",
   "autoResize": false,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "seed": 742461640,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1043542271,
   "index": "b0172"
