   "index": "b0179"
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1785777351988,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "id": "gYO8_EneE8VU9o129Czu_",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1494,
   "y": 2572,
   "width": 462.00000000000006,
   "height": 840.0,
   "text": "SUBAGENT ROSTER  -  every one is a PURE FUNCTION\nno tools, no loop, no state.  input -> JSON -> exit.\n================================================\nS1 design_classifier            tier A\n   in : title, abstract, MeSH, publicationType\n   out: {design_rank, confidence}\n   only fires when deterministic tags are ambiguous\n\nS2 synthesis_extractor          tier B   HIGHEST VALUE\n   in : SR full text (JATS or PDF text)\n   out: {included_studies[], characteristics[], rob_table[]}\n   one call yields data for ~15 primaries\n\nS3 study_extractor              tier B\n   in : full text or abstract\n   out: {n, arms, dose, form, duration, population,\n         registration_id}\n\nS4 rob_scorer                   tier B\n   in : methods section + ct.gov record\n   out: {item1..item6, evidence_spans[]}\n\nS5 conclusion_extractor         tier B\n   in : results + discussion\n   out: {outcome_raw, direction, effect_size, ci, p}\n\nS6 outcome_mapper               tier C   HIGHEST RISK\n   in : outcome_raw string\n   out: {outcome_vocab_id | NULL}\n   NULL means DISCARD. never guess.\n\nS7 form_normalizer              tier A/B\n   in : intervention description\n   out: {form_vocab_id, salt_family, elemental_dose}\n\nS8 funding_classifier           tier A\n   in : funding statement + COI statement\n   out: {independent|undisclosed|brand_funded, brand}\n================================================\nNO SUBAGENT FOR: dedup, ID resolution, scoring,\nband mapping, cache. All deterministic code.\n\nCONTRACT RULES\n - every output carries evidence spans (char offsets)\n   -> auditable, legally defensible\n - schema violation: retry x2, then NULL + flag\n - cache key = hash(content, prompt_version, model)\n   prompt change invalidates correctly, reruns free",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "YZ2s3DtylTpbgJdw-n7cv",
   "originalText": "SUBAGENT ROSTER  -  every one is a PURE FUNCTION\nno tools, no loop, no state.  input -> JSON -> exit.\n================================================\nS1 design_classifier            tier A\n   in : title, abstract, MeSH, publicationType\n   out: {design_rank, confidence}\n   only fires when deterministic tags are ambiguous\n\nS2 synthesis_extractor          tier B   HIGHEST VALUE\n   in : SR full text (JATS or PDF text)\n   out: {included_studies[], characteristics[], rob_table[]}\n   one call yields data for ~15 primaries\n\nS3 study_extractor              tier B\n   in : full text or abstract\n   out: {n, arms, dose, form, duration, population,\n         registration_id}\n\nS4 rob_scorer                   tier B\n   in : methods section + ct.gov record\n   out: {item1..item6, evidence_spans[]}\n\nS5 conclusion_extractor         tier B\n   in : results + discussion\n   out: {outcome_raw, direction, effect_size, ci, p}\n\nS6 outcome_mapper               tier C   HIGHEST RISK\n   in : outcome_raw string\n   out: {outcome_vocab_id | NULL}\n   NULL means DISCARD. never guess.\n\nS7 form_normalizer              tier A/B\n   in : intervention description\n   out: {form_vocab_id, salt_family, elemental_dose}\n\nS8 funding_classifier           tier A\n   in : funding statement + COI statement\n   out: {independent|undisclosed|brand_funded, brand}\n================================================\nNO SUBAGENT FOR: dedup, ID resolution, scoring,\nband mapping, cache. All deterministic code.\n\nCONTRACT RULES\n - every output carries evidence spans (char offsets)\n   -> auditable, legally defensible\n - schema violation: retry x2, then NULL + flag\n - cache key = hash(content, prompt_version, model)\n   prompt change invalidates correctly, reruns free",
